&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;49.0％&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:15pt;min-height:15pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;追加取得した議決権比率&lt;/p&gt;
